  "version": "1.6.8",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "contains_code": true,
  "description": "1.6.8 修「季后赛」按钮有一定概率点不开：按钮动作原来是翻转（open = !open），而这个 host 在同一个按钮上会同时触发 click 和 path-event 两个通道，两者只要不落在同一帧就各触发一次，翻转两次抵消回原状，表现为点了没反应。改为幂等置位：按钮只负责开，关交给 × 和 F8。对照实测，kpl_scout 的打开动作本来就是幂等置位，同样的双通道注册从未出过这个问题。同时修两处同源缺陷：底部栏被引擎整体重建后按钮不再重绑（kpl_scout 实测日志里同一按钮重绑了 1172 次）；面板建立失败 3 次后整局放弃（一次瞬时失败就再也打不开，改为降频重试）。另加存档诊断键 kpl_diag_po_btn。\n1.6.8 fixes the Playoffs button sometimes not opening: its action was a toggle (open = !open) while this host fires both the click and the path-event channel for the same button; when the two land on different frames they each fire, toggling twice and cancelling out. The button is now idempotent: it only opens, X and F8 close. For reference kpl_scout's open action is already idempotent and never showed this. Two related defects fixed as well: the button was not re-bound after the engine rebuilds the bottom bar (kpl_scout's log shows 1172 rebinds of one button), and panel creation gave up for good after 3 failures. Adds diagnostic key kpl_diag_po_btn.\n\n把中国赛区改成 KPL 的 S/A/B 分组赛制：每组三个单循环（45 场），每轮积分清零并按名次重新分组（含卡位赛 BO7），赛季末统一 12 队双败 BO7 季后赛（16 场）加 7-10 名排位，推送最终名次与对阵新闻，并修正国际杯抽签的挂名队与重复席位。每个赛段开始（春季开档、夏季 6/22 转会期）先随机抽签分三组；第一轮显示为「KPL 一组/二组/三组」，第二轮起为 S 组/A 组/B 组，季后赛统一显示「KPL 季后赛」——命名只改显示层，不动联赛 ID、赛区和积分。底部「季后赛」按钮可展开完整 16 场对阵面板（轮次、日期时刻、队徽、实时比分），绕开原生页面只有 8 个卡位的问题，赛后推送当日战报。中国赛区（含 K 甲、青训队与新生成选手）统一使用 KPL 风格中文名，能力值不变。S/A/B 为同一联赛级别，不再有 S↔A 升降级、降级履历或赞助层级惩罚；B↔K甲 升降级保留。\n\n1.6.7 修「季后赛」面板空白且 × 关不掉：关闭按钮的绑定原来排在 16 张卡片全部建完之后，而每帧只建 3 张、任何一张建不出来就直接返回 —— 卡片没建完，关闭按钮就永远绑不上事件，面板显示出来却点 × 没反应。现在关闭按钮在第一帧就绑；卡片单张失败只跳过不阻断，并会自愈（发现第 0 张实际不存在就把进度归零重建），新建成一批时立刻补一次绘制，不再等下一秒。另加面板自检键 kpl_diag_po（各节点是否建出来、进度、赛程行数）。\n1.6.7 fixes the empty Playoffs panel and its dead X button: the close handler used to be bound only after all 16 card subtrees were built, but only 3 are built per frame and any failure returned early -- so if the cards never finished, the close button never got its handler and the panel could be shown but not closed. The close button is now bound on the first frame; a failing card is skipped instead of aborting, the card build self-heals (if card 0 turns out to be missing the progress resets and rebuilds), and a freshly built batch triggers a redraw immediately instead of waiting for the next second. Adds a panel self-check key kpl_diag_po (which nodes exist, progress, schedule line count).\n\n1.6.6 继续修国际杯抽签，查的是「修法自己失效」而不是偏移：①种子表定位的失败计数从不重置，前 4 次失败后退避成 64 个 tick 才重试，而 tick 按天推进——等于 64 天盲区，换存档还带着上一份进度；改为指数退避（封顶 32）、命中清零、读档作废。②名额归一化只改「年份最新」那条，但引擎是追加写入，若已备好下赛季条目就会改到错的那份；改为对所有「已申请队伍」的条目生效。③结构校验把赛事类型写死 0..3，而引擎建表按 1..4 传参，若落盘是后者整张表会被判无效、修正永久失效；放宽到 0..8。另：诊断写入存档键 kpl_diag_seed。\n1.6.6 kept fixing the draw, this time the fix disabling itself rather than a wrong offset: the lookup backoff was 64 ticks (64 days) and persisted across saves; normalisation only touched the newest year while the engine appends; the type check rejected anything above 3. Now exponential backoff capped at 32, cleared on a hit and on load; all populated entries; types 0-8; diagnostics in kpl_diag_seed.\n\nKPL (King Pro League) S/A/B format for the CN region: three single round-robins per group (45 matches), per-round standings reset with regrouping (plus BO7 card matches), and a unified 12-team double-elimination BO7 playoff (16 matches) with 7-10 placement games. Final-rank and bracket news are pushed, and international-cup draws get their placeholder teams and duplicate seats fixed. Each split opens with a random draw into three groups (at save start for Spring, at the 6/22 transfer window for Summer); round 1 is labelled \"KPL Group 1/2/3\", rounds 2-3 use \"KPL S/A/B\", and playoffs always show \"KPL Playoffs\" — display-only, never touching league ids, regions or standings. A \"Playoffs\" button opens a full 16-match bracket panel (round, date/time, logos, live scores), working around the native pages' 8-slot limit, with a daily report after each playoff day. Every CN athlete (second division, academy and newly generated) gets a KPL-style Chinese name without changing stats. S, A and B share one league tier: no S-to-A promotion/relegation, relegation tags or tier-based sponsor penalties; B-to-K甲 promotion is kept.\n\n1.6.5 fixes the international-cup draw on 0.6.5: the seed allocation table sits at a different place in the game's memory in each build, and the old code only looked at one of them, so on 0.6.5 the per-region slot normalisation silently did nothing. It now walks the known locations and confirms each by structure, so both builds are handled.\n1.6.4 fixes the international-cup draw crash (hit on both 0.6.5 and current builds): group B's playoff slots were cleared and then force-finalised in the same call, but the back-fill routine only looks at non-finalised containers, so B could never be refilled — CN supplied 2 teams short in the Challengers East pool, leaving 14 teams and an out-of-bounds fallback. The back-fill now runs before finalising. Also fixes the per-region slot normalisation silently doing nothing after the game moved the memory offset used to read the current year; the year is now read from inside the allocation entries themselves.\n1.6.0-1.6.3 add 0.7.0 Expansion and manager-move support, a faster management turn (read caching), and in-game OVR that matches the roster rating; ratings now use ten seasons of official data (2023 Spring - 2026 Summer) with career honours folded in.\n1.1.0-1.5.0 add Chinese names across the CN region, one tier for S/A/B, the 16-match playoff panel with daily reports, and the real 2026 Summer rosters.\nBest used together with the KPL + Real LoL Teams data mod.",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-26",
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "mod_id": "base",
      "version": ">=0.6.0"
    }
  ]
}